│    uid is the primary key and must remain unchanged.               │
│  • Derived.reset(): Should only modify non-primary key fields      │
│    (e.g., f) and not alter the uid field.                          │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                           4. Conclusion                            │
│                                                                    │
│ The bug is caused by the reset() method in Derived attempting to   │
│ modify the uid field (a primary key), which is not allowed. The    │
│ save() method in Item should also ensure that the uid is           │
